{"title":"2018 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CRITICALLY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CRITICALLY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e3d81a14957607d271691b35dd0ebb9fcf8557e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum^{100}_{i=1} \\sum^{100}_{j=1} (i+j) ?\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/0/650de08bdc2710ecd75f77056e3619e3378d79d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }100{,}100 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }500{,}500\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }505{,}000 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }1{,}001{,}000 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }1{,}010{,}000 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"669\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall that the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> positive integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/ceb5779c70f0e2e5ca01ebebb9d9ea030fb8cc55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum^{100}_{k=1} k = \\frac{101\\cdot100}{2}=5050.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"202\" height=\"56\" /> It follows that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66dc9b993df3ad05437f321f1d0bfba6ace9f3e1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\sum^{100}_{i=1} \\sum^{100}_{j=1} (i+j) &amp;= \\sum^{100}_{i=1} \\sum^{100}_{j=1}i + \\sum^{100}_{i=1} \\sum^{100}_{j=1}j \\\\ &amp;= \\sum^{100}_{i=1} (100i) + 100 \\sum^{100}_{j=1}j \\\\ &amp;= 100 \\sum^{100}_{i=1}i + 100 \\sum^{100}_{j=1}j \\\\ &amp;= 100\\cdot5050 + 100\\cdot5050 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }1{,}010{,}000}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"304\" height=\"240\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall that the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> positive integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/ceb5779c70f0e2e5ca01ebebb9d9ea030fb8cc55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum^{100}_{k=1} k = \\frac{101\\cdot100}{2}=5050.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"202\" height=\"56\" /> It follows that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a79b3e855440a338a60309a61adbb43291db010.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\sum^{100}_{i=1} \\sum^{100}_{j=1} (i+j) &amp;= \\sum^{100}_{i=1} \\left(\\sum^{100}_{j=1} i + \\sum^{100}_{j=1} j\\right) \\\\ &amp;= \\sum^{100}_{i=1} (100i+5050) \\\\ &amp;= 100\\sum^{100}_{i=1} i + \\sum^{100}_{i=1} 5050 \\\\ &amp;= 100\\cdot5050+5050\\cdot100 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }1{,}010{,}000}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"304\" height=\"237\" />\n~Vfire ~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall that the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> positive integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/ceb5779c70f0e2e5ca01ebebb9d9ea030fb8cc55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum^{100}_{k=1} k = \\frac{101\\cdot100}{2}=5050.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"202\" height=\"56\" /> Since the nested summation is symmetric with respect to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/4/dd49ba3dba42310ae25ee9972e7bd1ed90c7cc61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"14\" height=\"17\" /> it follows that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/8/8c8f620c3c2b73a41fa424eeadb04e2d3ba8a361.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\sum^{100}_{i=1} \\sum^{100}_{j=1} (i+j) &amp;= \\sum^{100}_{i=1} \\sum^{100}_{i=1} (2i) \\\\ &amp;= 2\\sum^{100}_{i=1} \\sum^{100}_{i=1} i \\\\ &amp;= 2\\sum^{100}_{i=1} 5050 \\\\ &amp;= 2\\cdot(5050\\cdot100) \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }1{,}010{,}000}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"251\" height=\"236\" />\n~Vfire ~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/771ef4092d4105545b3e8ac0cfaa24d0bb250fca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\cdot100=10000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"139\" height=\"14\" /> terms, and the average value of both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8122aa89ea6e80784c6513d22787ad86e36ad0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/b/aab304b08fed74663f391c7ed0c462fb7d2a91b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{101}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" /> Therefore, the sum becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/138e491e752345f21664292e5cd3897464b0ce7f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10000\\cdot\\left(\\frac{101}{2}+\\frac{101}{2}\\right)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }1{,}010{,}000}.\\]\" width=\"314\" height=\"43\" />\n~Rejas ~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We start by writing out the first few terms:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/b/28b38041be1d966548a3ea535833719f4bef7a90.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{ccccccccc} (1+1) &amp;+ &amp;(1+2) &amp;+ &amp;(1+3) &amp;+ &amp;\\cdots &amp;+ &amp;(1+100) \\\\ (2+1) &amp;+ &amp;(2+2) &amp;+ &amp;(2+3) &amp;+ &amp;\\cdots &amp;+ &amp;(2+100) \\\\ (3+1) &amp;+ &amp;(3+2) &amp;+ &amp;(3+3) &amp;+ &amp;\\cdots &amp;+ &amp;(3+100) \\\\ [-1ex] &amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;\\vdots&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\ (100+1) &amp;+ &amp;(100+2) &amp;+ &amp;(100+3) &amp;+ &amp;\\cdots &amp;+ &amp;(100+100). \\end{array}\\]\" width=\"524\" height=\"104\" />\nFrom the first terms in the parentheses, the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/2/6d2539bfd22d0331762a7f91ba4024076e07ddc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+\\cdots+100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"164\" height=\"14\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> times vertically.\n</p><p>From the second terms in the parentheses, the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/2/6d2539bfd22d0331762a7f91ba4024076e07ddc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+\\cdots+100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"164\" height=\"14\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> times horizontally.\n</p><p>Recall that the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> positive integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b415e6ea98f8d6a5dbc875b4c9fb0e787628995.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+\\cdots+100=\\frac{101\\cdot100}{2}=5050.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"328\" height=\"38\" /> Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/1/9f17812793fa6d7b944c485358dccc18d7f23724.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\cdot\\left(5050\\cdot100\\right)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }1{,}010{,}000}.\\]\" width=\"259\" height=\"28\" />\n~RandomPieKevin ‎~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When we expand the nested summation as shown in Solution 5, note that:\n</p>\n<ol style=\"margin-left: 1.5em;\">\n  <li>The term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> time. <p>\nThe term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times. </p><p>\nThe term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times. </p><p>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/7/087594ea26fa196b8e61bc20a36228270dc695f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"10\" /> </p><p>\nThe term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bb6fb7a3ff722532798b45607025254679e7b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> times. </p><p>\nMore generally, the term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f05f085f774fc8ab50676b778b86a1f1d1114fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> times for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67cb4c450b1b7b5966d95100d9b9facc79a4732d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\in\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,100\\}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"168\" height=\"20\" /></p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></li>\n  <li>The term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/9/419924dabadec1cbc40ad235df6230a545e2161f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$102$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times. <p>\nThe term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/6368131bf9f3ee40f7c304ba121adb1bedd15165.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$103$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/73119f04d6ae5f6eb4afc8c9c946a5744a11be50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$98$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times. </p><p>\nThe term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f1d39d686be9b35cb35cc512559edffbfbfcd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$104$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/9/239430b0fc1c7fe38f296a8845ed7446198bda7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$97$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times. </p><p>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/7/087594ea26fa196b8e61bc20a36228270dc695f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"10\" /> </p><p>\nThe term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> time. </p><p>\nMore generally, the term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda72131d8cef1be38ebe8a8d916d1dd5e2c549b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> occurs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/0/6a0c10d1d025d610f2aa2fbbf0138ff5c76f4608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> times for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c1591802f77676e2e5b12f057a8b9bdc6f1d9a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\in\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,99\\}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" /></p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></li>\n</ol>\n<p>Together, the nested summation becomes \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/8/3e834bc66c609e1af3571685aaf0482408817e3a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\sum^{100}_{k=1}\\left[(k+1)k\\right] + \\sum^{99}_{k=1}\\left[(k+101)(100-k)\\right] &amp;= \\sum^{100}_{k=1}\\left[k^2+k\\right] + \\sum^{99}_{k=1}\\left[-k^2-k+10100\\right] \\\\ &amp;= \\sum^{100}_{k=1}k^2 + \\sum^{100}_{k=1}k - \\sum^{99}_{k=1}k^2 - \\sum^{99}_{k=1}k + \\sum^{99}_{k=1}10100 \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\sum^{100}_{k=1}k^2 - \\sum^{99}_{k=1}k^2\\right) + \\left(\\sum^{100}_{k=1}k - \\sum^{99}_{k=1}k\\right) + \\sum^{99}_{k=1}10100 \\\\ &amp;= 100^2+100+10100\\cdot99 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }1{,}010{,}000}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"724\" height=\"236\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CRITICALLY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CRITICALLY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CRITICALLY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CRITICALLY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/flvmGmDmwZ8\">https://youtu.be/flvmGmDmwZ8</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B\" title=\"2018 AMC 12B\">2018 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2018 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" s